          "sub:Why did the photographer have the records key?"
        ]},
        { "id": "a3_records", "trigger": "enter", "arg": "records", "do": [
          "title:RECORDS — SUB-LEVEL 1",
          "sub:Fifty years of the building watching itself."
        ]},
